('16826','{19676}>{$CLICKHOUSE.PARTS.PER.PARTITION.WARN} * 0.9','ClickHouse: Too many MergeTree parts','','0','2','Descease INSERT queries frequency.\r\nClickhouse MergeTree table engine split each INSERT query to partitions (PARTITION BY expression)\r\nand add one or more PARTS per INSERT inside each partition,\r\nafter that background merge process run, and when you have too much unmerged parts inside partition,\r\nSELECT queries performance can significate degrade, so clickhouse try delay insert, or abort it.',NULL,'0','0','0','','0','','1','','0','ClickHouse: Too many MergeTree parts (over 90% of {$CLICKHOUSE.PARTS.PER.PARTITION.WARN})','21e6d3c6047145c59cbd00032699ee99',''),
