('17018','{19951} > {$PG.CONFLICTS.MAX.WARN:"{#DBNAME}"}','PostgreSQL: DB [{#DBNAME}]: Too many recovery conflicts','','0','3','The primary and standby servers are in many ways loosely connected. Actions on the primary will have an effect on the standby. As a result, there is potential for negative interactions or conflicts between them.\r\nhttps://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/hot-standby.html#HOT-STANDBY-CONFLICT',NULL,'0','2','0','','0','','0','','0','PostgreSQL: DB [{#DBNAME}]: Too many recovery conflicts (over {$PG.CONFLICTS.MAX.WARN:"{#DBNAME}"} in 5m)','05ac4216e1a941df8880224ffd38b806',''),
