('18521','({24439}<>{24440} and {24441}<>"online")','NetApp AFF A700: {#VOLUMENAME}: Volume state is abnormal','','0','3','A volume can only be brought online if it is offline. Taking a volume offline removes its junction path. The \'mixed\' state applies to FlexGroup volumes only and cannot be specified as a target state. An \'error\' state implies that the volume is not in a state to serve data.',NULL,'0','2','1','({24439}<>{24440} and {24441}="online")','0','','1','','0','','b00f339ed1a9450ba096cabababcf76e',''),
