('23520','{33380}=0 and {33381}=2','MSSQL: AG \'{#GROUP_NAME}\' Replica \'{#REPLICA_NAME}\': {#REPLICA_NAME} is disconnected','','0','2','The response of an availability replica to the "Disconnected" state depends on its role:\r\nOn the primary replica, if a secondary replica is disconnected, its secondary databases are marked as "Not synchronized" on the primary replica, which waits for the secondary to reconnect;\r\nOn a secondary replica, upon detecting that it is disconnected, the secondary replica attempts to reconnect to the primary replica.',NULL,'0','2','0','','0','','0','','0','','7c6afc5596e94af0979bd20d5ef542ea',''),
