('22404','{30995}<0 and {30996}>0\r\nand\r\n({30997}=6 or {30997}=1)\r\nand\r\n({30998}<>2)','Linux: Interface {#IFNAME}: Ethernet has changed to lower speed than it was before','','0','1','This Ethernet connection has transitioned down from its known maximum speed. This might be a sign of autonegotiation issues. Acknowledge to close the problem manually.','22396','0','2','1','({30995}>0 and {30999}>0) or\r\n({30998}=2)','0','','1','Current reported speed: {ITEM.LASTVALUE1}','0','','',''),
